        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "ConcentrationReferenceBasis represents the denominator or reference scope used for concentration calculation, such as the final product mass, an article mass, a product part mass, or a material group mass. It is distinct from the reporting level and from the concrete product part to which the information may refer."
